 893| ##### stringifyJson
 894| 
 895| Type: `Function`\
 896| Default: `JSON.stringify()`
 897| 
 898| User-defined JSON-stringifying function.
 899| 
 900| Use-cases:
 901| 1. Stringify JSON with a custom `replacer` function.
