1411| ### NetworkError
1412| 
1413| The error thrown when a network error occurs during the request (e.g., DNS failure, connection refused, offline). It has a `request` property with the [`Request` object](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Request). The original error is available via the standard `cause` property.
